    "https://jobs.wgu.edu/staff-corporate-careers": {
      "title": "Staff & Corporate Careers",
      "description": "Staff & Corporate Roles | WGU Skip to content Jobs Search\n                All Jobs Academic\n                Careers Staff\n                & Corporate Careers Tech\n                Careers Schools School\n                of Technology School\n                of Business School\n                of Health School\n                of Education Life at WGU Life\n                at WGU Where\n                We Work Total\n                Rewards Search all jobs Close Site Navigation Careers Home Jobs Search All Jobs Academic Careers Staff & Corporate Careers Tech Careers Affiliates Schools School of Technology School of Business School of Health School of Education Life at WGU Where We Work Total Rewards How We Hire Talent Community (opens in new tab) Search all jobs Staff & Corporate Careers Powering What's Possible Staff and corporate teams power the operations behind WGU. By improving services and solving real problems, they\n        shape the day-to-day experience for learners and teammates across the university. Where Your Work Makes Learning Possible Operations Learner Support & Advising Support learners as enrollment counselors, learner services team members, or academic advisors\n                        by guiding them through key moments in their journey. Credentialing & Records Help keep records accurate and moving forward through transcript evaluation, credential intake,\n                        and records processing. Student Operations Serve learners directly through contact center, learner support, or case management roles focused on resolving questions\n                        and removing barriers. Program & Course Operations Support course delivery through scheduling, assessment coordination, and program operations that\n                        keep learning on track. Administrative Services Provide day-to-day coordination and support as a coordinator, assistant, or office operations\n                        professional. Corporate People & Talent Support teams across recruiting, HR, enablement, and people operations that help employees grow\n                        and succeed. Finance & Accounting Contribute to financial planning and stability through FP&A, accounting, procurement, or payroll\n                        roles. Marketing & Communications Help share the story through brand, content, digital, and communications work. Legal, Risk & Compliance Support responsible decision-making through legal operations, compliance, audit, and risk roles. Strategy, PMO & Advancement Help move priorities forward through program management, business operations, and advancement work. External Relations & Partnerships Build and manage partnerships that support programs, outreach, and shared initiatives. Hear from Our People \"The culture of support and kindness is unlike anywhere I have worked before. I am so grateful for the\n              feeling of belonging I already have at WGU. There isn't a much better feeling than good people doing good\n              things.\" Sam B., Visual Designer \"The culture here is welcoming, energizing, and it is apparent everyone has a shared sense of purpose. It\n              has been exciting to step into a role where growth is encouraged from day one.\" Etyeno U., Consumer Insights Researcher \"Over the past four years at WGU, I've had the opportunity to grow in ways I never expected, moving across\n              multiple roles and ultimately stepping into a people leader position. The organization and my team truly\n              supports internal growth.\" Rose R., Sr. Manager, College and Audience Marketing \"I've truly valued my time at WGU and the opportunity to work with such a talented creative team.\n              Partnering with writers, designers, and fellow video professionals has helped me grow and continually\n              elevate my work.\" Bobby G., Manager, Creative \"One thing has stayed constant throughout my time here at WGU, it's the INCREDIBLE humans I get to work\n              with day in and day out. It is an absolutely magnificent feeling to see how people live and breathe WGU's\n              mission out here. The genuine care, the highest levels of integrity, the fire/fuel to want to make a real\n              difference/impact in one another's lives and I can keep going on and on. WGU has molded me into a better\n              person, instilling values and lessons that will stay with me for a lifetime. I am truly blessed to be part\n              of this organization and owe all of my learning/growth to the amazing individuals that have been and will\n              be part of my lifelong journey!\" Sab K., Manager, Business Process Engineering Get Answers and Take the Next Step Sage can answer questions, help you explore roles, and guide you through applying at WGU, right when you\n          need it. Chat now Open Jobs I'm Looking For Positions Near Use your location Search Search filters Filter Results Job Category General Administration 3 Marketing 4 People & Talent 3 City KANSAS CITY 1 Salt Lake City 9 State Missouri 1 Utah 9 Clear Filter Showing 1 - 10 of 10 jobs Sort By Date Date Job Title HR Shared Services (P&T People Support Specialist II) Job Location Salt Lake City, UT Salt Lake City, UT Posting Date: 09/04/2026 JR-026099 FULL_TIME Apply Now Clinical & Field Experience Assistant Job Location Salt Lake City, UT + 1 More Locations United States Remote Posting Date: 09/03/2026 JR-026094 FULL_TIME Apply Now Learning Experience Designer, Internal Job Location Salt Lake City, UT Salt Lake City, UT Posting Date: 09/02/2026 JR-026042 FULL_TIME Apply Now Manager, Data Analytics Job Location Salt Lake City, UT Salt Lake City, UT Posting Date: 09/01/2026 JR-026043 FULL_TIME Apply Now Executive Assistant Job Location Salt Lake City, UT Salt Lake City, UT Posting Date: 09/01/2026 JR-025957 FULL_TIME Apply Now Manager, Lifecycle Engagement, Organic Growth and E-commerce, Salt Lake City, UT Job Location Salt Lake City, UT Salt Lake City, UT Posting Date: 09/01/2026 JR-025641 FULL_TIME Apply Now Onsite Nursing Lab Simulation Technician - Kansas City, MO - Part Time Job Location KANSAS CITY, MO Kansas City, MO Posting Date: 08/25/2026 JR-025967 PART_TIME Apply Now HR Program Manager - Performance Job Location Salt Lake City, UT Salt Lake City, UT Posting Date: 08/25/2026 JR-025451 FULL_TIME Apply Now Marketing Technology Manager Job Location Salt Lake City, UT Salt Lake City, UT Posting Date: 08/18/2026 JR-025951 FULL_TIME Apply Now Marketing Automation & Quality Technologist Job Location Salt Lake City, UT Salt Lake City, UT Posting Date: 08/17/2026 JR-025925 FULL_TIME Apply Now Explore Roles Academic Staff & Corporate Tech SME About WGU Life at WGU Benefits Where We Work Affiliates Visit wgu.edu Resources How We Hire Search Jobs Join Our Talent Community Privacy Policy | Cookie Policy | Contact Us © WGU. All rights reserved."
