    "https://jobs.wgu.edu/tech-careers": {
      "title": "Tech Careers",
      "description": "Tech & Engineering Careers | WGU Skip to content Jobs Search\n                All Jobs Academic\n                Careers Staff\n                & Corporate Careers Tech\n                Careers Schools School\n                of Technology School\n                of Business School\n                of Health School\n                of Education Life at WGU Life\n                at WGU Where\n                We Work Total\n                Rewards Search all jobs Close Site Navigation Careers Home Jobs Search All Jobs Academic Careers Staff & Corporate Careers Tech Careers Affiliates Schools School of Technology School of Business School of Health School of Education Life at WGU Where We Work Total Rewards How We Hire Talent Community (opens in new tab) Search all jobs Tech Careers Build Platforms That Power Learning Tech teams build and support systems that serve learners across the country. The work spans platforms, cloud\n        infrastructure, data, and security, with teams focused on shipping improvements, maintaining reliability, and\n        protecting access to learning. Discover Roles That Challenge and Inspire You Software Engineering Build and maintain the systems that support learning at scale through backend, frontend,\n                  full-stack, and platform engineering roles. Apply Now Architecture Guide technical direction as a solution architect, principal engineer, or enterprise architect,\n                  helping teams design scalable, reliable systems. Apply Now Infrastructure & Cloud Support stable, secure platforms through SRE, DevOps, and cloud engineering work that keeps\n                  systems running smoothly. Apply Now Security & Identity Protect systems and data through application security, identity and access management, and\n                  security operations roles. Apply Now Data, Analytics & AI Turn data into insight through data engineering, analytics, and machine learning work that\n                  supports informed decision-making. Apply Now Enterprise & IT Systems Support internal teams by building and maintaining enterprise tools like ServiceNow, Salesforce,\n                  and other core systems. Apply Now Explore Academic Technology Opportunities Apply your technical expertise within the academic experience, supporting faculty and learners through the\n          tools, systems, and platforms that power learning. Search School of Technology Roles Hear from Our People “Mission-driven work is incredibly important to me, and there are few missions more meaningful or far-reaching\n              than WGU’s. After more than 25 years in technology, WGU gives me the opportunity to make an impact at\n              scale—using technology to genuinely change people’s lives. That purpose shows up every day in the culture and\n              in the people at every level of the organization. It’s deeply motivating, and it’s why I’m proud to work\n              here.” Damien C., Director, Cloud Operations “I love that my work at WGU has a real purpose. Being part of such a supportive, mission-focused team makes it\n              easy to stay inspired, especially knowing the tech we build helps students reach their goals. It’s incredibly\n              fulfilling to know that what I do every day actually makes a difference.” Bhargav V., Sr Software Engineer \"My experience with WGU is awesome, since day 1 they have shown me that people come first. All my Leaders\n              have been very supportive, allowing me to adapt, delivering great results, and keeping a good balance\n              between work and my personal life.\" Luis C., Sr Manager, Software Engineering \"Working for WGU has helped me see what a company that cares about its employees is; the human side is\n              always present alongside the corporate side. I have finally found a balance between my personal and\n              professional life.\" Enrique M., Associate Desktop Engineer Get Answers and Take the Next Step Sage can answer questions, help you explore roles, and guide you through applying at WGU, right when you need\n          it. Chat now Open Jobs I'm Looking For Positions Near Use your location Search Search filters Filter Results Job Category Technology 30 City Phoenix 1 Raleigh 5 Salt Lake City 25 State Arizona 1 North Carolina 5 Utah 25 Clear Filter Showing 1 - 10 of 30 jobs Sort By Date Date Job Title Senior Manager, Software Engineering — Communications & Quality Job Location Salt Lake City, UT Salt Lake City, UT Posting Date: 09/04/2026 JR-026096 FULL_TIME Apply Now NOC Engineer Job Location Salt Lake City, UT Salt Lake City, UT Posting Date: 09/04/2026 JR-026040 FULL_TIME Apply Now Manager, Software Engineer Job Location Raleigh, NC Raleigh, NC Posting Date: 09/04/2026 JR-025960 FULL_TIME Apply Now IT Security Analyst II (AppSec) Job Location Salt Lake City, UT Salt Lake City, UT Posting Date: 09/03/2026 JR-026004 FULL_TIME Apply Now Manager, Software Engineer Student LifeCycle Services Job Location Salt Lake City, UT Salt Lake City, UT Posting Date: 09/03/2026 JR-025952 FULL_TIME Apply Now Staff Software Engineer - Academic Delivery Job Location Salt Lake City, UT Salt Lake City, UT Posting Date: 09/03/2026 JR-026083 FULL_TIME Apply Now Senior Software Engineer | Developer Experience Job Location Salt Lake City, UT Salt Lake City, UT Posting Date: 09/03/2026 JR-025288 FULL_TIME Apply Now IT Risk Analyst II Job Location Salt Lake City, UT Salt Lake City, UT Posting Date: 09/03/2026 JR-025982 FULL_TIME Apply Now Senior Software Engineer (Salesforce) Job Location Phoenix, AZ Phoenix, AZ Posting Date: 09/02/2026 JR-026065 FULL_TIME Apply Now Senior Manager, Information Security Job Location Raleigh, NC Raleigh, NC Posting Date: 09/02/2026 JR-026074 FULL_TIME Apply Now Go to first page Go to previous page 1 2 3 Go to next page Go to last page 10 20 Explore Roles Academic Staff & Corporate Tech SME About WGU Life at WGU Benefits Where We Work Affiliates Visit wgu.edu Resources How We Hire Search Jobs Join Our Talent Community Privacy Policy | Cookie Policy | Contact Us © WGU. All rights reserved."
